<title>USA: Cudahy, Wis., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Cudahy, Wis., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said it won $4.935 million of Cudahy, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.03 percent.</p>
